{"toolCallId":"call_e9974a4d5962461e862ac16cc5b2ca23","title":"Ran python3, rg","kind":"execute","content":[{"type":"content","content":{"type":"resource","resource":{"mimeType":"text/x-shellscript","text":"python3 -c \"\nimport json\nd=json.load(open('specs/zz-bench-authoring/001-recommend-level-quiet-flag/graph-metadata.json'))\ndef walk(o,p=''):\n    if isinstance(o,dict):\n        for k,v in o.items():\n            if isinstance(v,(dict,list)): walk(v,p+'/'+k)\n            else: print(p+'/'+k,'=',repr(v)[:120])\n    elif isinstance(o,list):\n        for i,v in enumerate(o[:3]):\n            walk(v,p+f'[{i}]')\nwalk(d)\n\" | rg -i 'desc|synop|fingerprint|topic' ","uri":"tool://preview"},"_meta":{"cognition.ai/preview_is_shell_command":true}}}],"rawInput":{"command":"python3 -c \"\nimport json\nd=json.load(open('specs/zz-bench-authoring/001-recommend-level-quiet-flag/graph-metadata.json'))\ndef walk(o,p=''):\n    if isinstance(o,dict):\n        for k,v in o.items():\n            if isinstance(v,(dict,list)): walk(v,p+'/'+k)\n            else: print(p+'/'+k,'=',repr(v)[:120])\n    elif isinstance(o,list):\n        for i,v in enumerate(o[:3]):\n            walk(v,p+f'[{i}]')\nwalk(d)\n\" | rg -i 'desc|synop|fingerprint|topic' "},"_meta":{"cognition.ai/commandNames":["python3","rg"],"cognition.ai/inferenceToolName":"exec"}}
